# minute

- _minute(d)_

Answer the integral minute field of the date and time value _d_.

```
>>> '2024-03-04T21:41:30.000Z'
>>> .parseDateAndTime
>>> .minute
41
```

* * *

See also: DateAndTime, hour, month, parseDateAndTime, second, year

